# Dejo needs NO API key. Nothing here is required to run it.
#
# The only secrets Dejo ever uses are website passwords, and it never stores them in
# memory. A step remembers THAT a password is typed, never which one. At replay time the
# value is read from here, or from ~/.dejo/secrets.json.
#
# Name the variable after the site and the field:
#     DEJO_SECRET_<SITE>_<FIELD>
# with every character that is not a letter or number turned into an underscore.

# DEJO_SECRET_BILLING_ACME_COM_PASSWORD=your-password-here
